+/// A prompt chunk suspended between its layers (TF_GLM_FILL_SLICE_MS): its ids duped (a step's slice may outlive the
+/// caller's buffer), the next layer `j`, and the flags its first slice ran the forward with. One at a time, and only
+/// its slot's steps resume it -- a slice never commits part-way, so kept states stay on the chunk grid they keep.
+pub const PartialFill = struct {
